          "copies/xr433hz5827.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "stamped across the roll, upright in the upper panel, smudged and seemingly struck twice. The second figure carries a diagonal and a crossbar, so a 4 rather than the 1 of the third figure; the fourth is a 0 with a stray hooked stroke above it. The closing 5 is inked only along its top bar and stem."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
